Priority: P0
Title:    [P0] Remediate /usr/lib64/httpd/modules/libphp.so (VULNERABLE, SAPI: apache2handler)
Steps:
  1. Upgrade PHP on branch 8.5 to >= 8.5.12.
  2. Temporary configuration mitigation diff (applies to CVE-2026-109619 only; not a fix):
     --- a/php.ini
     +++ b/php.ini
     -session.upload_progress.enabled = 1
     +session.upload_progress.enabled = 0
     -fatal_error_backtraces = 1
     +fatal_error_backtraces = 0
Commands:
  [Upgrade RPM package] dnf upgrade php
Restart Hints:
  - reload Apache (e.g. systemctl reload apache2 or systemctl reload httpd)
Notes:    WARNING: A configuration mitigation is a temporary risk reduction only and is NOT a fix. CVE-2026-109618 has no known configuration mitigation; upgrading PHP is required.
